{"id":"en_the-secret-of-the-charging-cable","title":"The Secret of the Charging Cable","titleEn":"The Secret of the Charging Cable","description":"Legendary architect Aiden hides in plain sight in Neopolis, disguising himself as an ordinary 5W charger to keep his wife Elena safe. His sacrifice means little to her, though, and she turns to Gordon, whose black-market fast charge lures her away. After his rebirth under the name Zero, Aiden seals off her protocols. Left bricked and discarded, Elena decays among the trash while Aiden takes control of Neopolis with unchallenged authority. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-secret-of-the-charging-cable/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-secret-of-the-charging-cable/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["All-Too-Late","Karma Payback","Revenge","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm39o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-secret-of-the-charging-cable_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm39o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-of-the-charging-cable_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm39o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-of-the-charging-cable_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm39o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-of-the-charging-cable_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad